WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.960
You did it!

2
00:00:00.960 --> 00:00:04.160
Every teammate made it safely across.

3
00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:07.200
But here's what makes this a leadership challenge:

4
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:08.800
you didn't succeed by moving

5
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.080
everyone as quickly as possible.

6
00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:13.680
You succeeded by understanding their different

7
00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:16.480
abilities, planning ahead, and making decisions

8
00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:18.960
that worked for the entire team.

9
00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:21.520
That's what leadership looks like.

10
00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:23.440
Congratulations, Summit Strategist.

11
00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:26.200
You've earned your Leadership Curiosity Award!
